  helperId: magic_helper
  title: Magic Combat
  bodyText: "You have gained your first magic weapon. Some weapons require a secondary
    support item to be equipped in order to use them. For magic weapons you will
    need either a focus or runes and for ranged weapon, they will require arrows.
    \n\nMaigc attacks will consume mana to cast but they will also provide elemental
    ailments based on their type and chance. This ice weapon adds chill upon hitting
    enemies which causes them to move slower per stack. \n\nHitting 'Tab' and equipping
    the magic weapon on your secondary gear set. This makes switching between two
    styles easy."
